<title>USA: Laurel, Md., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Laurel, Md., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said it won $13.255 million of Laurel, Md., general obligation public improvement and refunding bonds, 1996, Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.055 percent.</p>
</text>
